sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 普通用户
    actor Merchant as 商家管理员
    participant UserUI as Assistant
    participant MerchantUI as MerchantSupport
    participant API as frontend/src/api.ts
    participant Sec as SecurityConfig
    participant Ctrl as ApiControllers
    participant Chat as AssistantService
    participant Store as DemoStore
    participant AI as Agnes/本地回退
    User->>UserUI: 选择商家并发送消息
    UserUI->>API: POST /conversations/{merchantId}/messages
    API->>Sec: 携带用户 Token
    Sec->>Ctrl: 校验 USER
    Ctrl->>Chat: sendUserMessage(current,merchantId,content)
    Chat->>Store: 校验商家并保存 ChatMessage
    Chat->>AI: 请求 AI 回复（可选）
    AI-->>Chat: 回复或本地回退
    Merchant->>MerchantUI: 查看会话并回复
    MerchantUI->>API: POST /merchant-admin/conversations/{userId}/messages
    API->>Sec: 携带商家 Token
    Sec->>Ctrl: 校验 MERCHANT_ADMIN
    Ctrl->>Chat: sendMerchantMessage(current,userId,content)
    Chat->>Store: 校验商家归属并追加消息
    Store-->>UserUI: 返回同一会话消息
    alt 空消息或参与者不匹配
        Ctrl-->>UserUI: 返回 400/403，消息不写入
    end
